        "inlines": [
          {
            "kind": "text",
            "value": "MockMvc provides support for testing Spring MVC applications. It performs full Spring MVC request handling but via mock request and response objects instead of a running server."
          }
        ],
        "roles": [],
        "title": null
      },
      {
        "context": "paragraph",
        "id": null,
        "inlines": [
          {
            "kind": "text",
            "value": "MockMvc can be used on its own to perform requests and verify responses using Hamcrest or through "
          },
          {
            "id": null,
            "inlines": [
              {
                "kind": "text",
                "value": "MockMvcTester"
              }
            ],
            "kind": "monospace",
            "roles": []
          },
          {
            "kind": "text",
            "value": " which provides a fluent API using AssertJ. It can also be used through the "
          },
          {
            "inlines": [
              {
                "kind": "text",
                "value": "WebTestClient"
              }
            ],
            "kind": "xref",
            "target": "testing/webtestclient.html"
          },
          {
            "kind": "text",
            "value": " where MockMvc is plugged in as the server to handle requests. The advantage of using "
          },
          {
            "id": null,
            "inlines": [
              {
                "kind": "text",
                "value": "WebTestClient"
              }
            ],
            "kind": "monospace",
            "roles": []
          },
          {
            "kind": "text",
            "value": " is that it provides you the option of working with higher level objects instead of raw data as well as the ability to switch to full, end-to-end HTTP tests against a live server and use the same test API."
          }
        ],
        "roles": [],
        "title": null
      }
    ],
    "outline": null,
    "title": [
      {
        "kind": "text",
        "value": "MockMvc"
      }
    ]
  }
